    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "19 Diamond Hill is a wonderful 4 bedroom, family home (148 m2) situated on an elevated site, enjoying panoramic sea views of Cork harbour. The location in the heart of Monkstown is second to none with the village and all its amenities a short stroll away and there is also easy access to Cork city centre. Monkstown is well serviced by the 216 bus route and there are excellent schools, sporting clubs and pubs/restaurants in the village itself. \r\n\r\nNo. 19’s stand out feature is its breathtaking water views, the house itself is well laid out with generous living accommodation, combined with 4 good bedrooms. There is also a large garage and a mature garden to the rear. This light filled house is an opportunity to create a family home of real quality in one of Cork’s most desirable residential locations. \r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\nEntrance Porch with sliding door.\r\n\r\nEntrance hallway, split level with carpet floor covering and feature staircase. Cloakroom with built in shelving. \r\n\r\nLiving room with feature brick fireplace with fitted stove, sliding door to balcony and panoramic water views. Feature timber ceiling. \r\n\r\nKitchen with floor & eye level fitted units, integrated appliances, tiled floor, door to rear garden. \r\n\r\nDining room with carpet floor covering, views over rear garden and door to kitchen.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 with carpet floor covering, full-length fitted robe units incorporating dresser, panoramic water views. \r\n\r\nEnsuite with WC, WHB and shower, tiled floor and walls. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 with carpet floor covering, full-length built-in robe units.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 with carpet floor covering, fitted shelving and panoramic water views.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 with polished timber floor, full-length built-in robe units. \r\n\r\nGarage with up & over door and pedestrian access.\r\n\r\nMain bathroom with WC, WHB and bath with electric shower over, tiled floor and walls."
      },
